{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37480","headline":"秋夜不寐寄崔温进士 · 周朴","name":"秋夜不寐寄崔温进士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愁多难得寐，展转读书牀。\n不是旅人病，岂知秋夜长。\n归乡凭远梦，无梦更思乡。\n枕上移窗月，分明是泪光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}